            "value": "<p>You've spent enough time training in stage fighting and teaching a wide range of stunts that you can prepare your companions with directions on how to avoid peril in battle. You can @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Aid] an ally's Acrobatics or Athletics check with a Theater Lore check. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Swift Choreography] reaction.</p>"
